    "Converting recurring decimals into fractions:": {
      "items": [
        {
          "q": "Convert 0.777... to a fraction.",
          "a": "7/9",
          "hints": [
            "Let x = 0.777..., then multiply by 10 to shift the repeating part.",
            "10x = 7.777..., so 10x - x = 7.",
            "9x = 7, so x = 7/9"
